IGMP Proxy Plus is an igmpproxy fork with full control over how fast
multicast traffic stops after a receiver leaves:

- Fast leave per downstream interface: off (RFC 2236), on (immediate)
  or auto (immediate when the last tracked host leaves)
- Last member query interval (ms) and count
- Querier timers: robustness, query interval, response interval,
  startup query interval/count, per interface group membership timeout
- Upstream leave delay for instant channel zapping
- Live group table with per host timers
